Description: Ishtaria Gilgamesh datadisk - Epic of Gilgamesh story
 This is the Epic of Gilgamesh datadisk for Ishtaria, bringing the world's
 oldest surviving epic to life in a game world.
 .
 The datadisk features:
  * The ancient city of Uruk with 1362 houses modelled one by one
  * The Cedar Forest and its guardian Humbaba
  * Mount Mashu and the Scorpion Gate
  * The Waters of Death and Utnapishtim's dwelling
  * 189 NPCs, 56 of them named characters from the epic and its world
  * 11 quests following the epic narrative
  * 12 achievements
  * English and Czech translations
 .
 Based on the public domain translation by N. K. Sanders.
